\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces First-attempt prequential AUPC (frozen = no update; naive = REINFORCE-style updates; egc = reliability-gated credit). \textdagger {}pending the egc re-run with the corrected stream (the pre-audit egc cell never entered the update path --- dead-code bug, fixed 2026-08-23 --- and is a frozen-equivalent no-op). The CTS egc/egc\_conflict variants produced no reliable paired-branch credit (zero gradient tokens on every task; local gate passed nothing), i.e.\ no-op controls rather than mechanism runs; only frozen vs.\ naive is an informative update contrast at CTS. AppWorld is a floor measurement: the 4B model executes real calls but never meets the hidden checkpoints (n=1 per arm).}}{6}{table.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:main}{{1}{6}{First-attempt prequential AUPC (frozen = no update; naive = REINFORCE-style updates; egc = reliability-gated credit). \textdagger {}pending the egc re-run with the corrected stream (the pre-audit egc cell never entered the update path --- dead-code bug, fixed 2026-08-23 --- and is a frozen-equivalent no-op). The CTS egc/egc\_conflict variants produced no reliable paired-branch credit (zero gradient tokens on every task; local gate passed nothing), i.e.\ no-op controls rather than mechanism runs; only frozen vs.\ naive is an informative update contrast at CTS. AppWorld is a floor measurement: the 4B model executes real calls but never meets the hidden checkpoints (n=1 per arm)}{table.caption.14}{}}
